flf2a$ 8 8 15 -1 5 0 0
hairline blocks-3d: blocks receding one column right and one row up, the top of every stroke in a lower seven-eighths block and its right side in a left seven-eighths block, 8 rows.
Generated by tools/mkfont.mjs from fonts/block/src/hairline.txt; do not edit by hand.
Edit the bitmap and run: node tools/mkfont.mjs --all
Lowercase a-z repeat the capitals; undrawn characters are blank.
